  "content": "<article class=\"gv-story gv-photo-video\"><header class=\"gv-intro\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">Rockleigh, New Jersey · Wedding photography &amp; film</p><h1>Bianca &amp; Bobby<br><em>The Rockleigh</em></h1><p class=\"gv-lede\">Bianca and Bobby’s wedding at The Rockleigh, in film and photographs.</p><nav class=\"gv-story-nav\" aria-label=\"Explore this wedding\"><a href=\"#wedding-film\">The film</a><a href=\"#wedding-photographs\">The photographs</a></nav></header><section id=\"wedding-film\" class=\"gv-film-section\" aria-label=\"Bianca &amp; Bobby wedding film\"><div class=\"gv-film-heading\"><h2>The wedding film</h2></div><div class=\"gl-film-preview gv-film\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1280/720\"><img src=\"/assets/shorts/bianca-bobby.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"Bianca &amp; Bobby, from the existing GioLina portfolio\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"><button type=\"button\" data-mediazilla-src=\"https://mediazilla.com/9jzGeDjrO7\" data-film-title=\"Bianca &amp; Bobby\" aria-label=\"Play wedding film, Bianca &amp; Bobby\"><span>Play wedding film</span></button></div><p class=\"gv-caption\">Bianca &amp; Bobby · A film by GioLina Films</p></section><section id=\"wedding-photographs\" class=\"gv-editorial\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-story-title\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">Selected photographs</p><h2 id=\"gv-story-title\">The preparations and the celebration.</h2><p>Details and family moments before the ceremony, a wedding car portrait and an embrace during the celebration.</p></section><section class=\"gv-gallery\" aria-label=\"Selected photographs of Bianca &amp; Bobby\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/690ef6c3e99444cd.png\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Bianca and Bobby smiling together in a wedding car\"><img src=\"/assets/690ef6c3e99444cd.png\" srcset=\"/assets/690ef6c3e99444cd.png 617w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"617\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=