ia-label=\"View Bianca sharing an emotional moment with a family member\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-ca442767304646b2-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-ca442767304646b2-small.webp 640w, /assets/v26-ca442767304646b2.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1280/853\" alt=\"Bianca sharing an emotional moment with a family member\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-690a4934a745552a.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Bianca and Bobby embracing during their wedding celebration\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-690a4934a745552a-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-690a4934a745552a-small.webp 427w, /assets/v26-690a4934a745552a.webp 512w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"512\" height=\"768\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:512/768\" alt=\"Bianca and Bobby embracing during their wedding celebration\"></a></figure></section><section class=\"gv-context\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-context-title\"><div><p class=\"gv-kicker\">The setting · Bergen County</p><h2 id=\"gv-context-title\">The Rockleigh</h2></div><div><p>The Rockleigh is in Rockleigh, New Jersey. GioLina provided photography and cinematography for Bianca and Bobby; their film is featured here. Preparation photographs are part of the event story and are not presented as venue interiors.</p><a class=\"gv-text-link\" href=\"https://therockleigh.net/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Visit the venue website</a></div></section><div class=\"gv-collection-link\"><a href=\"/photography/wedding-collection/\">View the wedding photography collection</a></div><section class=\"gv-inquire\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-inquire-title\"><h2 id=\"gv-inquire-title\">Your wedding at The Rockleigh</h2><p>Share your date, venue and the coverage you have in mind.</p><a class=\"gv-button\" href=\"/contact/\">Inquire about your wedding</a><div class=\"gv-links\"><a href=\"/cinematography/\">Explore wedding films</a><a href=\"/photography/\">Explore wedding photography</a></div></section><section class=\"gv-next\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-next-title\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">Explore more wedding stories</p><h2 id=\"gv-next-title\"><a href=\"/weddings/naninas-in-the-park-belleville/\">Nicole &amp; Phil at Nanina’s in the Park</a></h2></section></article><script src=\"/photography-viewer.js\" defer></script><script src=\"/mediazilla-player.js\" defer></script>"
